<title>UK: SBC sets call, put warrants on S&amp;P 500 index.</title>
<headline>SBC sets call, put warrants on S&amp;P 500 index.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss Bank Corp has issued a total of 32 million American-style call and put warrants, in 16 equal tranches, on the S&amp;P 500 index, lead manager Schweizerischer Bankverein (Deutschland) AG said.</p>
<p> PAYMENT DATE    07.JAN.97		 MIN EXER LOT 1,000</p>
<p> LISTING	   FFT/DUES</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  $752.0 (1.5660/USD</p>
<p>* * * *</p>
<p> WARRANT     STRIKE	ISSUE	PREMIUM     GEARING</p>
<p> CALL A	$760	  6.43 DEM   6.6 PCT     18.1 TIMES</p>
<p>  PUT A	$760	  5.74 DEM   3.9 PCT     20.3 TIMES</p>
<p> CALL B	$780	  4.81 DEM   7.9 PCT     24.2 TIMES</p>
<p>  PUT B	$780	  7.26 DEM   2.5 PCT     16.1 TIMES</p>
<p> CALL C	$800	  3.46 DEM   9.4 PCT     33.7 TIMES</p>
<p>  PUT C	$800	  9.11 DEM   1.4 PCT     12.8 TIMES</p>
<p> CALL D	$820	  2.38 DEM  11.1 PCT     49.0 TIMES</p>
<p>  PUT D	$820	 11.32 DEM   0.7 PCT     10.3 TIMES</p>
<p> (EXERCISE PERIOD 08.JAN.97 - 16.JUL.97)</p>
<p>* * * *</p>
<p> CALL F	$760	 10.02 DEM   9.7 PCT     11.6 TIMES</p>
<p>  PUT F	$760	  7.44 DEM   5.3 PCT     15.7 TIMES</p>
<p> CALL G	$780	  8.33 DEM  10.9 PCT     14.0 TIMES</p>
<p>  PUT G	$780	  8.88 DEM   3.9 PCT     13.1 TIMES</p>
<p> CALL H	$800	  6.81 DEM  12.2 PCT     17.1 TIMES</p>
<p>  PUT H	$800	 10.57 DEM   2.7 PCT     11.0 TIMES</p>
<p> CALL I	$820	  5.47 DEM  13.7 PCT     12.4 TIMES</p>
<p>  PUT I	$820	 12.51 DEM   1.7 PCT	9.3 TIMES</p>
<p> (EXERCISE PERIOD 08.JNA.97 - 15.JAN.98)</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
